OL,3,GNEWSAStudents call for city's street
OL,4,Alights to stay on later
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents are calling for street lights
OL,7,Fto remain switched on until 03:00 in
OL,8,Fmore areas of a city.
OL,10,FStreet lights currently only remain on
OL,11,Fin some areas of Southampton, such as
OL,12,Fmain roads, shopping areas, high-crime
OL,13,Fareas, CCTV zones and safe routes.
OL,15,FMillie Fear is petitioning Southampton
OL,16,FCity Council to also leave lights on in
OL,17,Fstudent and residential areas to ensure
OL,18,Fpeople feel safer when walking to and
OL,19,Ffrom work and to better suit student
OL,20,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
